It's my view that it is unreasonable to set yourself up for a good game
by killing a tourist off on level 2 in an effort to get a strong character
with a camera in a later game.  It's also a little bizarre to meet your own
ghost.

The way I'd like to see this alleviated is for ghosts to carry random
treasure that they've picked up in their ethereal wanderings.
Alternatively ghosts of the same userid as the person playing currently
should be disallowed.  The problem here is that there might not be many
people actually playing hack on some machines.

Comments?  jeff m


